                                                                                                                                                                # ─── Frontend Environment Variables ──────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Copy this file to frontend/.env before running `npm run build`.
# VITE_ variables are baked into the JS bundle at build time by Vite.
# Changing them requires a rebuild.
#
# ── How API URL is resolved ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  The app auto-detects the backend URL at runtime:
#
#  Local dev  (localhost)       →  http://localhost:5001
#  Docker / custom domain       →  same origin as the frontend (no port suffix)
#                                  e.g. https://joyevents.speshway.site
#
# ── When to set VITE_API_URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  ONLY set this if your frontend and backend run on DIFFERENT servers/ports:
#
#  PM2 two-process on same VPS (frontend :8080, backend :5001):
#    VITE_API_URL=http://<your-server-ip>:5001
#
#  Separate backend domain:
#    VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
#
#  Docker with separate containers on different ports:
#    VITE_API_URL=http://<docker-host-ip>:5001
#
#  If backend and frontend are served from the SAME server/port
#  (Docker single container, Render, Railway, etc.) — leave this UNSET.
#
# VITE_API_URL=
